    "exitMessage": "Positives\nStrong Company Culture — Employee rated Aditi's culture 10/10, appreciating the positive work environment and organisational values.\nAdequate Work Resources — Employee confirmed being 100% equipped with the tools, resources and support needed to perform effectively.\nStrong Performance Feedback — Manager acknowledged professionalism, ownership, technical expertise and consistent contributions.\n\nConcerns\nManagerial Behavior (Indira) — Employee reported frequent yelling, harsh communication and a perceived lack of respect from the reporting manager.\nEmployee Grievance Handling — Employee felt that concerns escalated to PD were not adequately addressed or followed up.\nLack of Managerial Accountability — Employee reported that similar concerns had been raised during pulse connects without visible corrective action.\nTeam Morale — Employee indicated that other team members also experienced dissatisfaction with the manager's behaviour.",
